FIXED TARGET
def Klean135CanArrange.Lemmas.targetStatement
    (applyCmp : SortString → SortVal → SortVal → SortBool)
    (orderGe : SortVal → SortVal → SortBool)
    (orderablePair : SortVal → SortVal → SortBool) : Prop :=
  ∀ (W V : SortVal) (h : orderablePair V W = true),
    applyCmp ">=" V W = orderGe V W

The source-rule/obligation mapping is structurally exact, unique, ordered, and nonempty. The mathematical value-universe weakening is recorded separately.
